<title>USA: Taubman completes California acquisition.</title>
<headline>Taubman completes California acquisition.</headline>
<dateline>BLOOMFIELD HILLS, Mich. 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Taubman Centers Inc, a real estate investment trust, said Tuesday the Taubman Realty Group LP completed the acquisition of La Cumbre shopping center in Santa Barbara, Calif. for $22.3 million.</p>
<p>Taubman Centers is managing general partner of Taubman Realty Group, which owns, develops, acquires and operates regional shopping centers nationally.</p>
<p>&quot;We expect this acquisition to produce EBITDA in excess of $2.8 million during 1997 and to be immediately accretive to Taubman Realty Group's distributable cash flow,&quot; said Taubman Centers' president Robert Taubman.</p>
<p>((-- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
